      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we put these in the base fpmcu conf file, since we\u0027ll want it for all FPMCUs? I guess we will need to split it the base config into RISCV and ARM, unless there is a way to have conditionals based on architecture in the conf files. (I\u0027m not very familiar with them.) You don\u0027t need to make any changes to this CL; we can change it in a followup CL.",
